## Risks

### R-019
If the proposed draft artifact format is not specified
before Claude Code begins normalization,
the review step may become unclear or inconsistently applied.

### R-020
If Q-010 is not resolved before normalization begins,
Claude Code may operate without sufficient constraint definition,
increasing the risk of concept drift in the proposed draft.

